  "description": "Optional integration package that exposes an OpenUsd.Bridge.Grpc session to the OpenUsd Viewer's host-injected bridge seam. The embedding host supplies the coordinator, endpoint, and credential provider programmatically; this adapter never reads, persists, or displays a credential, and the base Viewer package keeps no gRPC or NVIDIA dependency.",
